  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>'비디오쇼'라는 앱으로 만들었고요, 수업시간 2시간을 할애했습니다.</p><p>아이들이 자랑스러워요~~~<br></p></div><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"v8d84k4kOWfD5q0DcH0D525\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v8d84k4kOWfD5q0DcH0D525?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY4ZDg0azRrT1dmRDVxMERjSDBENTI1IiwidGlkIjoiOWFjYWMzZTktZmViNy00YThhLTk4Y2MtOWY2ZWVlMTYyMzIyIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg0NTU4fQ.KukHca7F2pMVVRWyGpJmKNRzHgifsIj_jT_t_O5iE0s4AA8D_S2QHGqB05YVjFe1-1k0d6uF9UDf-L4Wn486YQ&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><iframe id=\"v940dcAcxvRvnuGAeRGJeqm\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v940dcAcxvRvnuGAeRGJeqm?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY5NDBkY0FjeHZSdm51R0FlUkdKZXFtIiwidGlkIjoiN2UyNTBmNjUtMTg4YS00ZGMxLTllOTYtMGM1MmY0Yjk1NTQzIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg0NTU4fQ.oG4QZKPjUzNOLinR3HY_nql5LckEfsbmg7718PhK5Tkjysa1fatUShMOwKxiD8Tf2sbFjEqoSKL3JIzJ0DiCDA&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br>